Pouzu
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 10 DEAL COLUMN
COLUMN 5 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 8 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 5 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 0 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 6 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 6 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 9 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 3 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
OR
    AND
        SRC Rank K
        DEST Empty
    DEST Size < 10
MOVE_STACK COLUMN COLUMN
AND
    DEST Size == 3
    AND
        DEST Rank K
        SRC Suit {HEARTS, SPADES}
DRAW
PILE ALL COLUMN Size > 0
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
